+# Cache Eviction Policy
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use LFU (Least Frequently Used) eviction for the cache, which prioritizes removing infrequently accessed entries over recently accessed ones in order to improve cache hit rates for workloads where certain items are accessed much more frequently than others.
